WEBVTT

00:01.580 --> 00:02.917
(The tassel crowns the knight.
The sword is snow white.)

00:02.941 --> 00:04.276
(In the silver saddle,
he rides like a shooting star.)

00:04.300 --> 00:07.516
(He kills a man within ten steps.
Invincible he is all the way ahead.)

00:07.540 --> 00:13.100
(He would leave once it's done.
No trace of him is to be found.)

01:26.100 --> 01:31.060
=Sword Snow Stride= (Season 1)

01:31.220 --> 01:34.460
=Episode 34=

02:11.810 --> 02:12.810
That's my sister.

02:12.860 --> 02:13.936
Senior, remember

02:13.960 --> 02:15.136
not to call her my sister

02:15.160 --> 02:15.936
and not to mention Jiang Ni.

02:15.960 --> 02:16.960
Um.

02:32.410 --> 02:33.410
Sister.

02:36.460 --> 02:37.979
I'm Xu Weixiong, greetings to Mr. Li.

02:38.335 --> 02:39.761
Your shouting of swords in Mount Longhu

02:39.785 --> 02:40.756
enlightened the benighted.

02:40.780 --> 02:41.910
You already knew it?

02:41.960 --> 02:43.089
It spread that fast?

02:43.635 --> 02:46.010
Thank you for escorting him
along the way.

02:46.735 --> 02:47.735
The sword is good.

02:48.760 --> 02:49.900
The Hongchi Sword

02:49.985 --> 02:51.316
is a gift for you.

02:51.340 --> 02:51.955
No need.

02:51.979 --> 02:52.862
I have a lot of swords.

02:52.886 --> 02:54.110
Just keep it.

02:56.660 --> 02:57.996
I only know some techniques,

02:58.020 --> 02:59.136
but I know nothing
about the art of swords.

02:59.160 --> 03:00.411
The sword will only be wasted

03:00.435 --> 03:01.900
in my hands.

03:02.010 --> 03:02.947
The sword is good indeed,

03:02.971 --> 03:04.560
and you've spent plenty of time on it.

03:05.035 --> 03:07.510
You're just being too modest.

03:07.635 --> 03:09.195
After I left Mount Longhu,
it doesn't make any difference

03:09.219 --> 03:10.739
whether there is a sword or not to me.

03:16.585 --> 03:17.585
Xu Weixiong.

03:17.635 --> 03:19.849
You are his second elder sister.
Don't test me.

03:20.535 --> 03:21.786
I promised Xu Xiao

03:21.810 --> 03:22.597
that I would make sure this boy
can go back to North Liang

03:22.621 --> 03:24.285
with no legs or arms missing.

03:24.560 --> 03:25.936
I would keep my word

03:25.960 --> 03:26.960
even in Wudi City.

03:27.235 --> 03:29.335
Thank you for keeping your word.

03:30.510 --> 03:31.560
I heard

03:32.735 --> 03:34.585
that you picked on Jiang Ni before?

03:38.010 --> 03:39.135
That's true.

03:40.010 --> 03:41.085
Do you look down on her?

03:42.235 --> 03:44.900
It's normal that sisters-in-law
don't get along.

03:45.510 --> 03:47.979
But it doesn't mean
the husband's family is all bad.

03:48.585 --> 03:50.186
They just want the wife

03:50.210 --> 03:51.690
to remember the merit of her husband.

03:52.510 --> 03:53.760
My mother passed away early.

03:54.160 --> 03:55.860
I have to be the villain.

03:58.335 --> 04:00.075
So you also think Jiang Ni

04:00.099 --> 04:02.085
can make a couple with this boy?

04:02.785 --> 04:04.085
Even a pig

04:05.010 --> 04:06.420
can tell that.

04:08.085 --> 04:09.085
All right.

04:09.735 --> 04:11.631
I was going to avenge Jiang Ni.

04:11.655 --> 04:13.860
Since you said that, I can't do it now.

04:14.360 --> 04:15.936
But I have to say,

04:15.960 --> 04:18.260
Xu Weixiong, you have a talent.

04:18.710 --> 04:20.760
But Jiang Ni is better than you!

04:22.035 --> 04:23.235
Do you hear it?

04:24.735 --> 04:26.310
He said that to you.

04:26.385 --> 04:27.555
What does Jiang Ni's martial art

04:27.579 --> 04:28.780
have anything to do with me?

04:29.085 --> 04:31.125
I don't care if Jiang Ni
disobeys you in the future.

04:33.860 --> 04:35.760
You're an interesting girl.

04:36.235 --> 04:37.596
Xu Xiao is lucky to have you two

04:37.620 --> 04:38.960
as his children.

04:39.410 --> 04:40.660
I also think so.

04:43.860 --> 04:46.635
Sister, why are you waiting for me here?

04:46.935 --> 04:48.055
You knew we would come here?

04:48.210 --> 04:49.516
Is there anyone

04:49.540 --> 04:50.860
who doesn't know where you are?

04:50.935 --> 04:52.160
I'm not that ostentatious.

04:52.285 --> 04:53.285
Let's talk

04:53.560 --> 04:54.860
at my place.

04:55.260 --> 04:55.886
Senior.

04:55.910 --> 04:56.535
Um.

04:56.910 --> 04:57.910
Mr. Li.

04:58.260 --> 05:00.610
I have some family affairs
to talk about with Xu Fengnian.

05:00.860 --> 05:03.110
No one can stop you
if you want to listen.

05:03.435 --> 05:04.396
Then I'm not going with you.

05:04.420 --> 05:05.420
You're not going...?

05:06.410 --> 05:07.516
You'd better stay here.

05:07.540 --> 05:08.161
Let's go.

05:08.185 --> 05:09.185
Eh.

05:10.685 --> 05:11.965
Let me borrow your Divine Token.

05:54.010 --> 05:55.090
There are few people today.

05:55.135 --> 05:57.376
Today is the triennial examination.

05:57.400 --> 05:58.636
They are not in the school now.

05:58.660 --> 06:00.140
The examination is not in the school?

06:00.360 --> 06:01.435
My class

06:01.459 --> 06:02.961
will be tested on geomantic omen today.

06:02.985 --> 06:04.259
They're going to Mount Difei

06:04.435 --> 06:05.756
to study the terrain

06:05.780 --> 06:06.716
and find the auspicious locations.

06:06.740 --> 06:07.860
Why didn't you go with them?

06:08.060 --> 06:08.939
I don't need to be tested.

06:09.035 --> 06:10.035
Why?

06:10.735 --> 06:12.339
Wang Jijiu who taught this class

06:12.710 --> 06:14.335
once had a geomantic-omen match with me

06:14.635 --> 06:15.960
and he lost to me three times.

06:16.210 --> 06:18.060
Then I don't need
to take the test anymore.

06:18.360 --> 06:19.819
You defeated your teacher?

06:20.135 --> 06:21.339
He took me as his teacher.

06:22.435 --> 06:23.960
What did the academy say?

06:24.810 --> 06:25.810
They're used to it.

06:25.860 --> 06:26.885
What do you mean?

06:27.735 --> 06:29.115
Chess, poetry, scripture,

06:29.139 --> 06:30.336
calligraphy and painting,
and incantation,

06:30.360 --> 06:32.120
the teachers of these classes
all lost to me.

06:32.685 --> 06:33.436
Recently,

06:33.460 --> 06:35.160
I've been teaching these classes.

06:36.220 --> 06:38.060
That's why these students
are so afraid of you?

06:38.910 --> 06:39.910
In this case,

06:40.110 --> 06:41.760
they should also call me teacher.

06:43.285 --> 06:44.935
You even beat your teachers.

06:45.210 --> 06:46.210
Sister.

06:46.635 --> 06:47.636
There is no one else like you.

06:47.660 --> 06:48.935
I'm no match for you.

06:49.210 --> 06:51.339
You come all the way
to Wudi City to die.

06:51.885 --> 06:53.735
Old Huang's sword box is in Wudi.

06:59.710 --> 07:00.870
Your Highness, there you are.

07:02.160 --> 07:02.996
Who is this?

07:03.020 --> 07:04.276
You've had a long journey.

07:04.300 --> 07:05.156
I'm your brother-in-law.

07:05.180 --> 07:06.085
He is not.

07:06.160 --> 07:07.160
Not for now,

07:07.485 --> 07:08.485
but I will be one day.

07:09.035 --> 07:10.035
Hold on.

07:18.635 --> 07:20.076
Your Highness, is it your first time
to visit Shangyin Academy?

07:20.100 --> 07:21.220
I've never been here before.

07:32.260 --> 07:33.685
I'll show you around sometime!

07:33.980 --> 07:35.435
There are many schools
at Shangyin Academy,

07:35.459 --> 07:36.836
and there are
a couple of interesting places.

07:36.860 --> 07:37.911
I'll leave soon.

07:37.935 --> 07:38.780
What a pity.

07:38.910 --> 07:40.110
Tell me in advance next time.

07:42.085 --> 07:42.661
Eh.

07:42.685 --> 07:43.685
The left side.

07:53.110 --> 07:54.150
Don't be eager to kill me.

07:54.185 --> 07:54.916
Let's get acquainted with each other.

07:54.940 --> 07:56.560
We can get acquainted after I kill you!

08:01.810 --> 08:02.620
Your Highness, please don't mind.

08:02.810 --> 08:03.699
If we keep chatting,

08:03.760 --> 08:04.856
your brother-in-law will be dead.

08:04.880 --> 08:05.880
I understand.

08:06.060 --> 08:07.060
What's your name?

08:09.485 --> 08:10.187
Zhao Kai.

08:10.211 --> 08:11.285
Maybe we will meet again.

08:18.810 --> 08:20.290
Another guy with the surname of Zhao.

08:20.960 --> 08:21.960
Let's go.

08:23.085 --> 08:23.819
Sister.

08:23.935 --> 08:25.235
He is kind of interesting.

08:28.385 --> 08:29.510
Forget what I said.

08:53.260 --> 08:54.510
I was in a hurry

08:54.935 --> 08:56.960
to catch up with Xu Fengnian
in Shangyin Academy.

08:57.585 --> 09:00.360
It's faster indeed to go by water.

09:01.135 --> 09:02.135
Where is he?

09:02.710 --> 09:04.190
He is heading for his sister's place.

09:04.360 --> 09:05.739
There's no one else around him.

09:06.010 --> 09:07.116
Don't you want to kill him?

09:07.140 --> 09:08.112
It's a good time.

09:08.136 --> 09:09.810
I can't do it here.

09:10.260 --> 09:11.561
It's just an academy.

09:11.585 --> 09:13.500
If I kill him here,

09:15.935 --> 09:17.685
I'll ruin my reputation.

09:18.060 --> 09:19.012
Then,

09:19.036 --> 09:20.819
what's the point of sounding him out?

09:21.210 --> 09:22.219
This is the safest place,

09:22.535 --> 09:23.819
and this is the only place

09:24.060 --> 09:26.300
where Li Chungang may not be with him.

09:26.760 --> 09:28.260
Keep an eye on Xu Fengnian.

09:28.610 --> 09:30.435
It would be the best
if you can hear what he says.

09:30.459 --> 09:31.459
If you can't,

09:31.485 --> 09:32.540
it's okay.

09:33.410 --> 09:34.410
What about you?

09:36.885 --> 09:39.460
I'm going to see Li Chungang.

10:06.460 --> 10:07.460
Come in.

10:32.235 --> 10:32.960
Senior.

10:33.185 --> 10:34.315
Doesn't Xu Fengnian ask you

10:34.339 --> 10:35.760
to rest in the ship?

10:35.885 --> 10:37.265
Feng City Lyupao

10:37.335 --> 10:39.090
still has something left in this world.

10:50.410 --> 10:51.710
Who taught you to say that?

10:52.585 --> 10:54.060
Someone wants to see you.

10:54.635 --> 10:55.339
Where is that person?

10:55.635 --> 10:57.115
Right behind the house on the street.

11:00.710 --> 11:01.710
Does Xu Fengnian

11:01.785 --> 11:03.060
know it?

12:17.385 --> 12:19.345
Sword God Li, your name
reverberates like thunder.

12:19.835 --> 12:20.835
It's my luck

12:21.560 --> 12:22.560
to meet you today.

12:24.135 --> 12:27.085
I was wondering

12:27.610 --> 12:28.675
if I should

12:28.699 --> 12:29.739
start with some small talk

12:30.010 --> 12:30.916
to show my politeness

12:30.940 --> 12:32.585
when I see you.

12:33.510 --> 12:34.979
Later I realized it's unnecessary.

12:35.810 --> 12:36.810
I'd better

12:37.110 --> 12:38.611
tell you my intention directly

12:38.635 --> 12:39.735
and be frank with you.

12:40.385 --> 12:41.112
Go on.

12:41.136 --> 12:42.360
I want to kill Xu Fengnian.

12:42.760 --> 12:44.315
There are a lot of people
who want to kill him.

12:44.339 --> 12:46.260
But no one can kill him with you around.

12:46.585 --> 12:48.035
That's why you are here to kill me?

12:48.560 --> 12:49.380
I'm not

12:49.510 --> 12:51.829
that overconfident.

12:55.210 --> 12:56.380
Since I knew

12:56.710 --> 12:59.035
you've been escorting Xu Fengnian
to the east,

12:59.610 --> 13:02.385
I've read many stories about you.

13:04.060 --> 13:04.997
Did you kill

13:05.021 --> 13:06.819
Feng City Lyupao yourself?

13:08.385 --> 13:09.385
Everyone knows it.

13:09.635 --> 13:11.385
But I think you didn't want to kill her.

13:13.485 --> 13:14.979
If I'm guessing it right,

13:15.335 --> 13:16.335
this is the reason

13:17.135 --> 13:19.380
why you had lived
in seclusion for years.

13:21.710 --> 13:23.410
Which old man told you that?

13:23.535 --> 13:24.535
Senior.

13:24.560 --> 13:25.585
I don't know

13:25.910 --> 13:28.180
what Xu Xiao offered you

13:28.385 --> 13:30.075
that make you protect Xu Fengnian,

13:30.099 --> 13:32.116
but I think I can also make an offer.

13:32.140 --> 13:33.555
I hope you can

13:33.579 --> 13:35.885
give me a chance to kill Xu Fengnian.

13:39.285 --> 13:40.285
You know what,

13:41.860 --> 13:43.780
although Feng City Lyupao died,

13:44.380 --> 13:45.939
there are still disciples

13:46.385 --> 13:47.500
of her sect

13:48.310 --> 13:50.020
living in the world.

13:52.160 --> 13:53.660
It's a small sect now.

13:54.160 --> 13:56.140
It has been a rocky time for them.

13:57.085 --> 13:58.085
This sect

13:58.635 --> 14:01.260
is her only existing inheritance.

14:03.160 --> 14:04.160
I guess

14:04.910 --> 14:06.156
probably you want to know

14:06.180 --> 14:07.236
where the sect is

14:07.260 --> 14:08.585
and who

14:09.085 --> 14:10.085
they are.

14:12.735 --> 14:14.060
If I don't agree,

14:14.160 --> 14:15.459
you will kill them all.

14:15.585 --> 14:17.535
Senior, it's not a threat.

14:21.610 --> 14:23.160
Whether you agree or not,

14:27.535 --> 14:29.085
I'll still give it to you.

14:31.385 --> 14:33.311
You took a lot of effort to find it.

14:33.335 --> 14:34.660
Now you just give it to me?

14:35.460 --> 14:36.560
This is my sincerity.

14:38.185 --> 14:39.185
Speaking of it,

14:39.735 --> 14:42.135
Xu Fengnian is neither your relative
nor your friend.

14:42.685 --> 14:44.180
Whatever Xu Xiao promised you,

14:45.010 --> 14:46.160
I can also do it for you.

14:46.735 --> 14:48.360
Whatever Xu Xiao can't do,

14:49.619 --> 14:51.210
I'm willing to do it for you.

14:58.460 --> 15:00.361
When are you going to kill Xu Fengnian?

15:00.385 --> 15:01.460
In Wudi City.

15:02.585 --> 15:03.660
It depends on

15:04.860 --> 15:06.885
if you're willing
to give me that chance.

15:13.360 --> 15:15.760
(To Sword God Li Only)

15:31.560 --> 15:32.810
That's where you live?

15:33.610 --> 15:34.610
Sister.

15:35.260 --> 15:37.660
Aren't you proficient
in all kinds of musical instruments?

15:38.135 --> 15:40.035
Why don't you hang a zither on the wall?

15:40.235 --> 15:41.660
You can write or draw something.

15:43.685 --> 15:46.365
Old Huang's sword box will always
be on the top of Wudi City's wall.

15:46.585 --> 15:48.425
It doesn't make any difference
when you get it.

15:48.660 --> 15:49.939
Turn the ship around

15:50.060 --> 15:51.620
and you can go back to North Liang now.

15:52.185 --> 15:53.310
I've waited long enough.

15:53.910 --> 15:55.430
I don't want Old Huang to get anxious.

15:57.435 --> 15:58.560
He's dead.

16:03.260 --> 16:04.310
I'll get anxious.

16:06.785 --> 16:07.865
You go back to North Liang.

16:08.835 --> 16:10.085
I'll get the sword box for you.

16:10.860 --> 16:11.860
Sister.

16:12.510 --> 16:13.819
You can't.

16:14.160 --> 16:15.435
Without Sword God Li escorting me,

16:15.459 --> 16:16.460
I can't get it, either.

16:16.710 --> 16:18.790
Do you know what the two
most conspicuous matters are

16:19.285 --> 16:21.260
right now?

16:24.460 --> 16:27.310
One is Li Chungang's visit
to Wudi City again.

16:27.385 --> 16:29.075
People all guess that he will

16:29.099 --> 16:30.136
have a match with Wang Xianzhi again

16:30.160 --> 16:31.579
and avenge his broken sword.

16:31.819 --> 16:33.459
Senior has no grudge
against Wang Xianzhi.

16:33.585 --> 16:35.145
He doesn't care about the broken sword.

16:36.785 --> 16:37.785
Will this battle

16:38.010 --> 16:39.010
take place?

16:42.485 --> 16:43.235
It's possible.

16:43.335 --> 16:44.810
Do you know what it means?

16:45.485 --> 16:46.387
It means

16:46.411 --> 16:49.036
it's probably a battle between
the two strongest people in the world.

16:49.060 --> 16:50.060
There are rumors

16:50.310 --> 16:51.339
that Deng Tai'e

16:51.585 --> 16:52.939
is also heading for Wudi City.

16:53.285 --> 16:54.435
Sword God Peach Blossom?

16:56.260 --> 16:58.219
Wang Xianzhi called himself
the Second Best,

16:58.310 --> 16:59.986
since then, no one has dared
to claim to be the best.

17:00.010 --> 17:01.036
Wang Xianzhi.

17:01.060 --> 17:02.185
Cao Changqing.

17:02.360 --> 17:03.561
(Deng Tai'e, Sword God Peach Blossom)
Deng Tai'e.

17:03.585 --> 17:05.036
(Deng Tai'e, Sword God Peach Blossom)
I think

17:05.060 --> 17:06.411
they are the three most powerful people
in the world.

17:06.435 --> 17:07.237
Now,

17:07.261 --> 17:09.835
Sword God Li reentered
the Realm of Immortal-on-Earth.

17:10.010 --> 17:12.161
There is one more candidate
for the most powerful masters.

17:12.185 --> 17:13.985
I definitely root for God Sword Li.

17:14.935 --> 17:17.385
Why would Deng Tai'e head for Wudi City?

17:19.110 --> 17:20.110
To watch the battle?

17:22.335 --> 17:24.460
It's said that those
who reach the ultimate realm

17:24.810 --> 17:26.099
would ascend to heaven.

17:28.760 --> 17:29.760
I know.

17:29.835 --> 17:32.780
It's said that Qi Xuanzhen,
the last master of Mount Longhu,

17:33.085 --> 17:34.619
ascended to heaven in the end.

17:35.985 --> 17:36.917
It's hard to tell

17:36.941 --> 17:38.139
if it's true,

17:39.185 --> 17:40.659
but there is one thing for sure.

17:41.110 --> 17:44.619
If Li Chungang and Wang Xianzhi
go all out,

17:44.885 --> 17:45.562
maybe

17:45.586 --> 17:46.986
they could open the gate of heaven.

17:47.085 --> 17:48.805
There would be a chance
to ascend to heaven.

17:50.010 --> 17:51.910
Therefore, Deng Tai'e

17:52.160 --> 17:54.060
wants to take this chance

17:54.485 --> 17:55.585
to ascend to heaven?

17:55.985 --> 17:56.937
At that time,

17:56.961 --> 17:58.610
you will also be in Wudi City.

18:00.035 --> 18:01.516
I kind of like here.

18:01.540 --> 18:02.900
I'm not going to ascend to heaven.

18:02.960 --> 18:04.315
If the three of them are in a melee,

18:04.339 --> 18:05.659
who can guarantee your safety?

18:06.385 --> 18:07.899
Even Li Chungang

18:08.085 --> 18:09.885
may not be able to protect you.

18:10.510 --> 18:11.510
It's like

18:12.010 --> 18:13.236
soldiers charging in a battle,

18:13.260 --> 18:13.940
and you are

18:14.085 --> 18:15.685
just an ant on the way.

18:16.310 --> 18:17.885
You can die in a blink of an eye

18:18.010 --> 18:19.730
and your life
totally depends on providence.

18:19.785 --> 18:20.596
Even so,

18:20.620 --> 18:22.335
are you still going to Wudi City?

18:24.835 --> 18:25.835
Yes.

18:27.260 --> 18:28.510
I know all the truth.

18:29.735 --> 18:31.210
Sister.

18:33.085 --> 18:34.535
There is a little problem.

18:35.160 --> 18:37.339
I don't want to be a Lord of North Liang
like Xu Xiao.

18:44.685 --> 18:45.835
Sister, don't worry.

18:46.060 --> 18:47.516
Whether it's Wang Xianzhi

18:47.540 --> 18:48.660
or Deng Tai'e,

18:48.935 --> 18:50.175
as long as I have God Sword Li,

18:50.410 --> 18:51.435
I'll be fine.

18:53.610 --> 18:54.835
If it was a few years ago,

18:55.235 --> 18:57.315
I would tie you up
and bring you back to North Liang.

19:00.585 --> 19:01.585
Sister.

19:01.860 --> 19:03.035
You said

19:03.419 --> 19:04.780
there are two conspicuous things

19:04.910 --> 19:05.940
in the world.

19:06.160 --> 19:07.160
What's the other one?

19:07.460 --> 19:08.916
It's surely your Jiang Ni

19:08.940 --> 19:10.760
and Cao Changqing going to West Shu.

19:12.635 --> 19:14.060
Everyone knows it now?

19:14.410 --> 19:15.595
The world is strife-torn.

19:15.619 --> 19:16.885
There will be a great tumult.

19:20.035 --> 19:21.285
The game

19:23.235 --> 19:24.935
has finally got here.

19:26.035 --> 19:27.285
You've been prepared?

19:27.610 --> 19:28.685
To be frank with you,

19:29.010 --> 19:30.419
Cao Changqing's whereabouts

19:30.859 --> 19:32.020
was spread

19:33.035 --> 19:34.385
thanks to my effort.

19:36.619 --> 19:37.619
Xu Fengnian.

19:38.285 --> 19:39.760
What exactly do you want to do?

19:40.660 --> 19:43.560
To make a big noise, of course.

19:52.251 --> 19:53.983
(The Imperial Palace of Liyang,
the Capital)

20:58.310 --> 21:00.260
We are in the Imperial Palace.

21:00.660 --> 21:02.510
You are His Majesty's eunuch.

21:02.985 --> 21:04.745
You don't need to kneel
to an alien official.

21:04.910 --> 21:05.910
Get up.

21:08.139 --> 21:09.179
Who is His Majesty

21:10.185 --> 21:11.385
meeting now?

21:12.010 --> 21:13.010
Prime Minister.

21:13.510 --> 21:14.510
Well...

21:14.885 --> 21:15.980
You shouldn't ask it.

21:31.435 --> 21:32.435
Leave me.

21:32.859 --> 21:33.859
Yes.

21:38.760 --> 21:39.760
Eh!

21:40.810 --> 21:41.395
Leave.

21:41.419 --> 21:42.419
Yes.

21:49.210 --> 21:50.810
Greetings to Prime Minister Zhang.

21:56.260 --> 21:57.260
Ah.

21:57.910 --> 21:59.485
His Majesty

21:59.560 --> 22:01.020
was meeting you.

22:04.635 --> 22:07.435
His Majesty is weary
of the national affairs.

22:08.135 --> 22:09.135
Today,

22:09.285 --> 22:11.525
I'm afraid he won't be able to see you.

22:21.385 --> 22:22.660
Has His Majesty

22:23.560 --> 22:24.835
read my memorial?

22:25.335 --> 22:25.980
Yes.

22:26.310 --> 22:27.310
He has.

22:31.910 --> 22:33.485
Then he should know

22:33.610 --> 22:35.024
how important it is.

22:35.410 --> 22:37.410
Shu has been a dangerous place
since ancient times.

22:37.685 --> 22:38.911
Most of the survivors of West Chu

22:38.935 --> 22:40.815
sneaked into Shu

22:41.135 --> 22:42.535
and raised weapons.

22:42.700 --> 22:43.960
Although it's troublesome,

22:44.060 --> 22:45.199
they are nothing but

22:45.485 --> 22:46.960
insignificant diseases.

22:48.560 --> 22:49.735
But now

22:50.460 --> 22:52.980
Cao Changqing is heading for Shu

22:53.235 --> 22:54.435
with the Princess of West Chu.

22:55.160 --> 22:57.210
They want

22:57.585 --> 22:59.085
to gather these people.

23:01.035 --> 23:02.035
It's said

23:02.510 --> 23:03.510
that they contacted

23:03.735 --> 23:06.260
about ten groups of rebels.

23:06.785 --> 23:08.210
It's going to be

23:08.585 --> 23:10.110
a huge mess.

23:11.535 --> 23:12.935
You're right.

23:35.535 --> 23:36.156
Sister.

23:36.180 --> 23:37.260
How about I wash your hair?

23:41.635 --> 23:43.355
You've been doing this
since you were a kid.

23:43.485 --> 23:45.585
You think I can't beat you
when my hair is wet?

23:45.940 --> 23:47.035
Sister.

24:07.635 --> 24:10.220
You deliberately let
Jiang Ni and Cao Changqing

24:10.510 --> 24:11.606
spread the news

24:11.630 --> 24:12.635
and make a deal out of it

24:14.160 --> 24:15.460
just to show the court?

24:17.385 --> 24:19.085
I knew I couldn't keep it from you.

24:22.160 --> 24:22.960
What's the reason?

24:23.110 --> 24:24.985
How do you think
the court will handle it?

24:26.285 --> 24:28.179
The most efficient way

24:28.635 --> 24:30.235
to quell the chaos in West Shu

24:30.910 --> 24:32.790
is to dispatch the North Liang Army
to the west.

24:32.910 --> 24:34.110
No matter how chaotic Shu is,

24:34.360 --> 24:36.240
there is no way to stop
the North Liang Cavalry.

24:36.510 --> 24:37.610
But the court

24:38.110 --> 24:39.685
would never take such a step.

24:52.985 --> 24:54.660
The reason is simple.

24:56.260 --> 24:59.899
We can't let the Xu family
plant a flag on the land of Shu.

25:00.510 --> 25:02.010
If it happens one day,

25:02.819 --> 25:03.460
West Shu

25:03.735 --> 25:04.540
and North Liang

25:04.685 --> 25:06.760
will join forces.

25:07.335 --> 25:08.335
The world

25:08.760 --> 25:10.235
will be no match for them.

25:13.035 --> 25:15.410
You've been wary of North Liang.

25:15.710 --> 25:18.099
Of course, you won't let that happen.

25:20.535 --> 25:21.535
Therefore,

25:22.010 --> 25:23.780
the safest way

25:24.310 --> 25:27.935
is to transfer Gu Jiantang
from the capital to the west.

25:30.360 --> 25:32.035
Among the four grand generals,

25:32.285 --> 25:33.860
except for Xu Xiao,

25:34.110 --> 25:35.935
there is only Gu Jiantang left.

25:37.610 --> 25:39.980
Gu Jiantang has been trapped
in the capital for years.

25:40.660 --> 25:41.819
If he goes to the west,

25:42.060 --> 25:44.099
your Jiang Ni won't last long.

25:44.810 --> 25:46.185
Do you think it could be him?

25:48.585 --> 25:49.819
If he leaves the capital,

25:50.335 --> 25:52.055
it's like releasing a dragon
back to the sea

25:52.335 --> 25:53.710
and a tiger back to the forest.

25:54.310 --> 25:55.700
Our emperor

25:56.360 --> 25:57.780
doesn't have the guts.

26:07.035 --> 26:08.585
In an unusual situation,

26:08.860 --> 26:10.780
we must take unusual actions.

26:12.210 --> 26:13.619
Let's think in a different way.

26:14.485 --> 26:15.660
If Gu Jiantang

26:15.785 --> 26:16.980
can lead the troops,

26:17.285 --> 26:18.911
the most restless place

26:18.935 --> 26:20.220
is not the capital,

26:20.685 --> 26:22.210
but North Liang.

26:24.835 --> 26:26.760
General Gu fell ill.

26:29.260 --> 26:30.485
What illness?

26:31.360 --> 26:32.510
It's said

26:32.835 --> 26:34.160
that he caught a cold.

26:38.835 --> 26:40.099
Caught a cold?

26:44.635 --> 26:48.260
The man who excels at the blade
could also catch a cold.

26:50.960 --> 26:52.061
At this moment,

26:52.085 --> 26:53.785
he only wants to protect himself.

26:56.060 --> 26:57.610
What does His Majesty say?

26:59.735 --> 27:00.886
He ordered to send him medicine

27:00.910 --> 27:02.885
and let him recuperate.

27:13.410 --> 27:14.410
Fine.

27:15.685 --> 27:17.660
Forget about Gu Jiantang.

27:18.410 --> 27:19.911
There is one more person in my memorial

27:19.935 --> 27:21.585
who can be used.

27:22.060 --> 27:23.435
If we dispatch this person,

27:23.860 --> 27:25.899
I'm sure we can
pacify the rebels in Shu.

27:27.260 --> 27:28.300
More importantly,

27:28.610 --> 27:30.179
with his talent,

27:31.760 --> 27:33.220
he might be able

27:33.685 --> 27:35.245
to change the situation of North Liang.

27:40.585 --> 27:42.435
(Xu)

27:42.685 --> 27:46.060
(Yinma River, North Liang)

27:56.435 --> 27:57.460
Report!

28:01.785 --> 28:02.785
General.

28:07.260 --> 28:08.435
(To Chen Zhibao Only)

28:10.579 --> 28:12.339
General Chen.

28:12.899 --> 28:14.859
There are rebels in West Shu
invading the borders.

28:15.210 --> 28:16.210
I think

28:16.310 --> 28:17.956
the court should send you

28:17.980 --> 28:20.035
to Shu to quell the chaos.

28:20.435 --> 28:22.885
If you volunteer to take this mission,

28:23.135 --> 28:25.700
I will recommend you in the court

28:26.010 --> 28:27.510
to be the second lord

28:27.710 --> 28:30.860
not born in the royal family.

28:31.185 --> 28:32.361
You will no longer be held in check

28:32.385 --> 28:34.235
by the Lord of North Liang.

28:34.660 --> 28:35.885
Sincerely,

28:36.110 --> 28:37.110
Zhang Julu.

28:44.460 --> 28:45.735
(Xu)

29:12.710 --> 29:13.710
Chen Zhibao

29:14.160 --> 29:15.619
is respected in the army.

29:15.910 --> 29:17.020
His prestige is high.

29:17.110 --> 29:19.909
He is the second most powerful man
in the North Liang Army indeed.

29:20.885 --> 29:22.686
If he is made a lord

29:22.710 --> 29:24.276
and ordered to lead his troops

29:24.300 --> 29:26.260
to quell the chaos in Shu,

29:26.710 --> 29:28.099
the North Liang Army

29:28.385 --> 29:30.460
may fall apart

29:31.160 --> 29:32.859
and collapse from inside.

29:36.535 --> 29:39.311
His Majesty also praised

29:39.335 --> 29:41.110
your sophisticated strategy.

29:41.460 --> 29:42.899
In that case,

29:43.229 --> 29:45.115
His Majesty should issue an order
as soon as possible.

29:45.139 --> 29:47.300
No matter how North Liang reacts,

29:47.660 --> 29:48.660
the army

29:48.985 --> 29:50.885
will be disturbed.

29:53.360 --> 29:56.060
It's just His Majesty has some concerns.

30:01.360 --> 30:02.660
What are the concerns?

30:03.760 --> 30:05.311
Xu Xiao is still alive.

30:05.335 --> 30:06.335
Chen Zhibao

30:06.585 --> 30:08.179
may not dare to take the order.

30:09.260 --> 30:10.260
May not?

30:10.760 --> 30:11.760
That's

30:12.110 --> 30:13.885
his concern?

30:14.410 --> 30:15.410
After all,

30:15.985 --> 30:18.694
Chen Zhibao is Xu Xiao's adopted son.

30:19.819 --> 30:21.259
Even a father and his biological son

30:21.335 --> 30:22.835
can turn against each other,

30:22.859 --> 30:24.260
not to mention an adopted son.

30:29.018 --> 30:32.685
♪ Millions of households in North Liang ♪

30:32.985 --> 30:37.660
♪ Many of which are dedicated soldiers ♪

30:38.035 --> 30:42.811
♪ Melt all the honor in a pot of wine ♪

30:42.835 --> 30:47.360
♪ How many shovelfuls of earth
can bury an emperor ♪

30:47.885 --> 30:50.536
♪ Rabbits in the mountains ♪

30:50.560 --> 30:52.636
♪ Foxes in the woods ♪

30:52.660 --> 30:57.185
♪ Swallow the world like a tiger ♪

30:57.585 --> 31:00.061
♪ Ten boxes of pearls ♪

31:00.085 --> 31:02.411
♪ A red stove of snow ♪

31:02.435 --> 31:06.935
♪ The girl with thin hands and waist
became alone ♪

31:06.985 --> 31:11.336
♪ A hundred thousand bows ♪

31:11.360 --> 31:12.355
Grand General!

31:12.379 --> 31:13.610
Grand General is back!

31:14.085 --> 31:15.363
- Grand General!
- Grand General!

31:15.387 --> 31:16.286
- Grand General is back!
- Yes.

31:16.310 --> 31:16.861
Grand General!

31:16.885 --> 31:17.885
I just came back

31:18.110 --> 31:19.610
and ran into such a lively occasion.

31:21.435 --> 31:22.760
What are you doing here?

31:23.210 --> 31:24.220
Drilling!

31:24.485 --> 31:25.211
Drilling?

31:25.235 --> 31:25.757
Yes.

31:25.781 --> 31:27.516
The detachment of Chihou Battalion
entered the woods

31:27.540 --> 31:28.410
and started to fight.

31:28.535 --> 31:29.916
There are also other means
of competition

31:29.940 --> 31:30.940
in the woods,

31:31.360 --> 31:32.211
and this is one of them.

31:32.235 --> 31:33.235
Oh.

31:33.360 --> 31:34.861
What's the prize?

31:34.885 --> 31:35.885
Winners eat meat!

31:37.835 --> 31:38.940
Grand General is back.

31:39.035 --> 31:40.335
He is in the woods now.

31:45.310 --> 31:47.385
Should we go to greet him?

31:54.860 --> 31:56.236
Don't stop! Continue!

31:56.260 --> 31:57.260
Come on!

31:57.685 --> 31:58.500
Grand General.

31:58.635 --> 31:59.686
Put it down.

31:59.710 --> 32:00.911
You have few people.

32:00.935 --> 32:02.619
You'll lose without my help.

32:02.659 --> 32:04.196
The situation on the battlefield
changes quickly.

32:04.220 --> 32:06.461
It's the destiny whether we have
more people or fewer people.

32:06.485 --> 32:07.485
Did Chen Zhibao

32:07.835 --> 32:09.236
come up with this method
of training soldiers?

32:09.260 --> 32:10.260
Yes.

32:13.285 --> 32:14.285
Where's that boy?

32:14.410 --> 32:16.635
He is watching the whole situation
from the tower.

32:19.110 --> 32:20.136
All right, go on!

32:20.160 --> 32:20.810
Continue!

32:20.935 --> 32:21.935
Yes!

32:36.760 --> 32:38.135
What is he doing up there?

33:02.760 --> 33:05.099
The land of North Liang
still belongs to the Xu family.

33:05.835 --> 33:07.179
His Majesty

33:07.285 --> 33:09.819
wants to use your strategy

33:09.960 --> 33:11.810
after Xu Xiao dies.

33:12.235 --> 33:14.859
Then we will let Chen Zhibao
and Xu Fengnian

33:15.010 --> 33:17.060
fight with each other.

33:18.260 --> 33:19.410
What about now?

33:19.935 --> 33:23.310
We need someone to lead the troops
to quell the chaos in Shu.

33:26.310 --> 33:27.700
It has been suggested

33:29.835 --> 33:31.795
not to use an army

33:31.819 --> 33:33.635
given the circumstances.

33:33.685 --> 33:35.859
Shu has always been chaotic.

33:35.985 --> 33:37.036
The cause

33:37.060 --> 33:38.360
of our problem right now

33:38.985 --> 33:41.085
is the Princess of West Chu.

33:41.760 --> 33:44.486
If the Princess of West Chu dies,

33:44.510 --> 33:46.185
those people

33:46.410 --> 33:48.410
would still be ill-organized.

33:51.659 --> 33:52.659
Assassination.

33:53.535 --> 33:54.535
Yes.

33:55.035 --> 33:57.139
Find someone to kill
the Princess of West Chu,

33:57.560 --> 33:58.635
then

33:58.659 --> 34:00.286
we can mediate

34:00.310 --> 34:02.139
and clear the mess.

34:03.535 --> 34:05.235
Cao Changqing is by her side.

34:05.510 --> 34:06.810
How to kill her?

34:07.685 --> 34:08.685
How?

34:09.435 --> 34:10.579
I don't know, either.

34:14.485 --> 34:15.860
Who came up with this idea?

34:18.510 --> 34:19.585
Not me.

34:36.660 --> 34:37.900
Where is Han Diaosi?

34:39.010 --> 34:40.160
Han Diaosi?

35:33.485 --> 35:36.060
No matter how the court
handles the mess caused by Jiang Ni,

35:37.260 --> 35:38.260
what about you?

35:39.085 --> 35:40.940
What are you trying to get out of this?

35:42.610 --> 35:44.035
What worries His Majesty most

35:44.660 --> 35:45.796
is the possibility

35:45.820 --> 35:47.860
of another North Liang in the world.

35:48.460 --> 35:49.460
Therefore,

35:49.585 --> 35:51.260
there is only one way

35:51.485 --> 35:53.004
to deal with Jiang Ni.

35:55.035 --> 35:57.675
People's minds change quickly,
and you are far away from the court.

35:57.985 --> 35:59.579
How can you be so sure

35:59.885 --> 36:01.445
about the countermeasures of the court?

36:02.010 --> 36:03.335
Do you have a spy

36:03.760 --> 36:05.179
in the capital?

36:05.910 --> 36:06.910
No.

36:07.310 --> 36:09.380
This is too important to go wrong.

36:09.635 --> 36:10.540
That person

36:10.610 --> 36:12.010
is definitely not a small potato.

36:12.685 --> 36:13.779
It's not a spy,

36:14.410 --> 36:15.510
but your accomplice.

36:18.085 --> 36:20.060
I can't hide anything from you.

36:21.310 --> 36:23.356
There are only a few people

36:23.380 --> 36:24.786
who can influence
his Majesty's decisions.

36:24.810 --> 36:26.085
You will figure it out

36:26.335 --> 36:27.860
if you keep guessing.

36:29.135 --> 36:30.610
Does Father know

36:30.885 --> 36:32.165
that you have an accomplice now?

36:36.560 --> 36:37.560
He doesn't know.

36:38.385 --> 36:39.885
You even keep it from Father.

36:41.285 --> 36:42.380
There's something

36:43.935 --> 36:45.785
I want to do myself.

36:48.660 --> 36:50.285
So, going to Wudi City

36:50.860 --> 36:52.411
is also part of your plan?

36:52.435 --> 36:53.435
No.

36:54.135 --> 36:56.055
I'm going to Wudi City
only for Old Huang's sake.

37:04.085 --> 37:05.380
What can I do for you?

37:07.060 --> 37:08.620
You don't want to ask
what I want to do?

37:10.535 --> 37:12.219
With all the information,

37:13.410 --> 37:14.179
I think

37:14.260 --> 37:15.581
I know what it is.

37:20.785 --> 37:22.710
I'm glad you're my sister.

37:33.885 --> 37:35.179
It's the Xuanyuan Family's ship.

37:35.785 --> 37:37.085
It's mine now.

37:37.285 --> 37:38.940
It's nothing that you took their ship.

37:39.310 --> 37:40.936
But don't take their daughter.

37:40.960 --> 37:41.960
Sister.

37:42.310 --> 37:44.160
I'm not interested in Xuanyuan Qingfeng.

37:44.460 --> 37:45.836
You don't need to explain it to me.

37:45.860 --> 37:46.756
As long as Jiang Ni trusts you.

37:46.780 --> 37:48.755
I used to pretend to be a playboy.

37:48.779 --> 37:50.460
It was fake. You know it.

37:51.310 --> 37:52.035
Your Highness.

37:52.210 --> 37:52.914
My Lady.

37:53.010 --> 37:54.010
Where are other people?

37:54.210 --> 37:55.210
In the barn.

37:55.635 --> 37:56.517
I remember

37:56.541 --> 37:58.259
Qingniao should be on duty today.

37:58.585 --> 37:59.625
She changed shift with me.

38:00.185 --> 38:01.779
Your maids

38:01.985 --> 38:03.179
and I don't get along.

38:03.985 --> 38:05.155
I think they are avoiding me.

38:05.179 --> 38:06.610
That's not true.

38:06.860 --> 38:08.356
Don't play dumb.

38:08.380 --> 38:10.035
Sister Weixiong!

38:14.235 --> 38:15.380
Who is that?

38:16.960 --> 38:17.716
Sister Weixiong!

38:17.740 --> 38:19.340
I'm your brother you never met!

38:19.435 --> 38:20.436
I found him on the road.

38:20.460 --> 38:21.910
He said Xu Xiao is his father.

38:22.110 --> 38:23.476
I finally meet you!

38:23.500 --> 38:24.860
I have a family again!

38:30.235 --> 38:31.106
- Brother!
- I'll walk you here.

38:31.130 --> 38:31.836
Help! Brother!

38:31.860 --> 38:32.736
- Be careful on the road.
- Sister Weixiong!

38:32.760 --> 38:33.311
- Help!
- I know.

38:33.335 --> 38:34.156
I can't swim!

38:34.180 --> 38:35.710
Brother! Brother!

38:38.510 --> 38:39.225
Brother!

38:39.249 --> 38:39.936
- Bodhisattva.
- Help!

38:39.960 --> 38:40.635
Come here.

38:40.935 --> 38:41.935
Brother!

38:43.935 --> 38:44.916
Sister Weixiong!

38:44.940 --> 38:46.110
Help! Sister Weixiong!

38:46.185 --> 38:47.960
Brother!

38:50.935 --> 38:52.595
Help!

38:52.619 --> 38:53.619
I can't swim!

38:54.110 --> 38:55.110
Brother!

38:56.785 --> 38:57.785
What's this?

38:57.835 --> 38:58.911
I found it on the road.

38:58.935 --> 38:59.986
- A male and a female.
- Brother!

39:00.010 --> 39:00.996
- The male is called Vajra.
- Brother!

39:01.020 --> 39:01.900
I gave it to Huangman'er.

39:02.010 --> 39:03.106
- This female...
- Help!

39:03.130 --> 39:04.236
- Is called Bodhisattva.
- Brother!

39:04.260 --> 39:05.260
It's for you.

39:05.935 --> 39:06.935
What's the use of it?

39:07.735 --> 39:09.476
- The academy is all about righteousness.
- Brother!

39:09.500 --> 39:11.020
- How boring it is to be alone.
- Help!

39:11.210 --> 39:12.850
It won't be that quiet
with it around you.

39:14.010 --> 39:15.010
Brother!

39:18.635 --> 39:19.212
Brother!

39:19.236 --> 39:20.311
I like quietness.

39:20.335 --> 39:21.660
Sister Weixiong! Help!

39:22.785 --> 39:23.785
It likes you.

39:24.110 --> 39:24.814
Sister Weixiong!

39:25.010 --> 39:26.482
Sister Weixiong! Help!

39:26.560 --> 39:27.840
I can't swim!

39:29.885 --> 39:30.611
Okay.

39:30.635 --> 39:31.161
Brother!

39:31.185 --> 39:32.185
I'm leaving.

39:32.335 --> 39:33.335
I'll wait for your news.

39:33.435 --> 39:34.276
Give me a hug before you leave.

39:34.300 --> 39:35.310
Help!

39:44.360 --> 39:45.360
Brother!

39:47.035 --> 39:48.035
Sister Weixiong!

39:48.310 --> 39:49.635
Brother!

39:53.035 --> 39:54.185
Help!

39:57.060 --> 39:58.500
Is everything all right on the ship?

39:59.385 --> 40:00.385
Yes.

40:01.110 --> 40:02.486
God Sword Li got off the ship.

40:02.510 --> 40:03.630
- Where is he now?
- Brother!

40:04.185 --> 40:05.185
He is back.

40:05.385 --> 40:06.385
- Okay.
- Brother!

40:06.510 --> 40:07.710
Then let's set sail.

40:08.060 --> 40:08.877
Brother!

40:08.901 --> 40:10.261
Should I get him out of the water?

40:10.435 --> 40:11.219
Brother!

40:11.410 --> 40:12.585
Help!

40:14.510 --> 40:16.035
Brother!

40:22.435 --> 40:23.561
Why?

40:23.585 --> 40:25.299
What did I say wrong?

40:27.185 --> 40:28.225
Where is Brother Fengnian?

40:31.310 --> 40:32.430
I'm going to see my brother.

40:32.535 --> 40:33.211
Hold on.

40:33.235 --> 40:34.235
Ah?

40:36.085 --> 40:37.210
Let your clothes dry first.

40:38.760 --> 40:40.285
Miss Shu, you are the best.

40:41.010 --> 40:42.410
You're wrong about me.

40:42.710 --> 40:43.710
I'm pretty bad.

41:01.885 --> 41:03.385
Where have Xu Fengnian

41:03.810 --> 41:04.810
and my wife been?

41:05.535 --> 41:06.760
They were talking in the room.

41:07.260 --> 41:08.586
I dare not get too close
and eavesdrop on them.

41:08.610 --> 41:10.299
Did Xu Fengnian come out

41:10.610 --> 41:11.960
when I was meeting God Sword Li?

41:12.285 --> 41:13.285
Absolutely no.

41:13.385 --> 41:14.385
That's good.

41:15.585 --> 41:16.685
What did Li Chungang say?

41:17.560 --> 41:19.085
I think he agreed.

41:19.885 --> 41:21.585
He won't step in

41:22.185 --> 41:23.235
when I kill Xu Fengnian.

41:24.335 --> 41:25.710
How did you do that?

41:26.410 --> 41:27.410
There is

41:28.710 --> 41:30.085
always something

41:31.360 --> 41:32.885
he cares about in the world.

41:37.910 --> 41:39.755
As a Sword God,

41:39.779 --> 41:41.210
he won't go back on his word.

41:41.885 --> 41:42.980
If he doesn't step in,

41:43.210 --> 41:45.035
I'll have a chance to kill Xu Fengnian.

41:45.785 --> 41:46.861
Where will you do it?

41:46.885 --> 41:48.110
Still in Wudi City.

41:49.185 --> 41:51.785
When Li Chungang and Wang Xianzhi
are fighting,

41:51.935 --> 41:53.835
we will kill Xu Fengnian.

41:54.385 --> 41:56.259
Since Li Chungang promised
not to protect him,

41:57.085 --> 41:58.635
why should we wait for them to fight?

41:58.785 --> 42:00.885
There are twelve martial slaves
in Wudi City

42:01.160 --> 42:03.155
who once lost to Wang Xianzhi.

42:03.179 --> 42:04.339
They are top martial artists.

42:04.460 --> 42:05.210
Now,

42:05.410 --> 42:07.410
they volunteer to stay
and guard Wudi City.

42:08.035 --> 42:08.957
When Xu Fengnian

42:08.981 --> 42:10.436
gets on the top of the wall
to get the sword box,

42:10.460 --> 42:12.300
the twelve martial slaves
will try to stop him.

42:12.360 --> 42:12.997
At that time,

42:13.021 --> 42:15.101
Xu Fengnian's guards
will have no time to protect him

42:15.160 --> 42:16.960
and it's the perfect time to kill him.

42:18.910 --> 42:20.635
I'm afraid the sword box

42:20.810 --> 42:21.970
is just Xu Fengnian's excuse.

42:23.160 --> 42:24.635
Does this young master

42:24.785 --> 42:26.610
really dare to offend Wang Xianzhi?

42:26.960 --> 42:28.035
I think

42:29.260 --> 42:30.310
he dares.

42:32.110 --> 42:33.435
A playboy.

42:34.085 --> 42:36.060
People are wrong about him.

42:37.035 --> 42:38.035
I think

42:38.985 --> 42:40.060
he and I

42:41.585 --> 42:42.760
are the same kind of people.

42:43.035 --> 42:44.035
What kind of people?

42:47.685 --> 42:49.135
We won't surrender to the destiny

42:49.985 --> 42:51.260
and we are shrewd.

42:52.235 --> 42:53.235
Come on.

42:53.960 --> 42:54.960
Let's go to Wudi City.

43:29.840 --> 43:32.560
♪ The flower of pain ♪

43:34.335 --> 43:37.135
♪ Blooms in my heart ♪

43:39.060 --> 43:41.980
♪ I made a bet with the dawn ♪

43:43.060 --> 43:46.860
♪ That you'll answer ♪

43:48.160 --> 43:51.060
♪ Forgive this tragic end ♪

43:52.760 --> 43:55.580
♪ Moved by the moment we met ♪

43:57.585 --> 44:00.340
♪ In spite of thunder and lightning ♪

44:01.360 --> 44:05.285
♪ In spite of my falling ♪

44:05.785 --> 44:08.516
♪ When we are apart ♪

44:08.540 --> 44:09.780
♪ I'll collapse ♪

44:10.560 --> 44:14.420
♪ Capture an image of the memory ♪

44:15.235 --> 44:17.961
♪ After all these ups and downs ♪

44:17.985 --> 44:19.420
♪ The vanity ♪

44:19.910 --> 44:23.785
♪ Who will open it again ♪

44:24.210 --> 44:25.561
♪ It's worth it ♪

44:25.585 --> 44:28.420
♪ It's enough ♪

44:28.835 --> 44:31.316
♪ Drowned in sadness ♪

44:31.340 --> 44:33.740
♪ Just to see through ♪

44:34.035 --> 44:36.061
♪ I will whisper love to you ♪

44:36.085 --> 44:38.261
♪ For a lifetime ♪

44:38.285 --> 44:42.500
♪ End the worry in the world ♪

44:42.860 --> 44:43.996
♪ It's worth it ♪

44:44.020 --> 44:47.060
♪ I'll be there for you all my life ♪

44:47.235 --> 44:49.196
♪ After the moments of beauty ♪

44:49.220 --> 44:51.940
♪ You are my reason to be ♪

44:52.500 --> 44:54.316
♪ If there is a way ♪

44:54.340 --> 44:56.836
♪ To start over ♪

44:56.860 --> 45:00.960
♪ Will you still remember me ♪
